    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You are trained in a metaphysical route — the Black Stair itself — connecting every threshold you have ever crossed.</em></p><p><strong>The Stair That Does Not End — 1/session.</strong> As an action, step through any door, arch, gate, or marked threshold within reach. You exit through any other threshold you have personally used in this campaign.</p><ul><li><p>You may bring up to <strong>4 willing allies</strong> with you.</p></li><li><p>The journey takes <strong>one hour of subjective time</strong> regardless of physical distance, planar boundary, or hostile interference between origin and destination.</p></li><li><p>Allies who travel report that the stair is <strong>steep, dim, and strangely familiar</strong>. (Track this. It will matter.)</p></li><li><p>This shares a 1/session pool with the class's Tier 4 Unfound Route — you can use one or the other per session, not both.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
